Subject: [PATCH] i2c: mediatek: use MT6765 counters and timeout

Program both clock dividers and the per-bank SCL timeout using the stock
MT6765 counter encoding. Refresh timing before transfers and reject invalid
settings. Keep the MT8183 timing path for its existing users.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6765.dtsi |  14 ++--
 drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mt65xx.c          | 131 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

